## 3. MAIN NEXT.JS APP RULES

- Super Admin login must use real API (`NEXT_PUBLIC_DEV_BYPASS_AUTH=false` unless user explicitly enables bypass)
- Four portals: SA `/superadmin/*`, CA `/admin/*`, Faculty `/faculty/*`, Student `/student/*` — middleware by role
- Login UI stays centered Quirri card (Poppins) — do not restyle from `Login.dc.html`
- Post-login UI follows `new_updated_design_four` (dark sidebar, Plus Jakarta Sans, mist `#F4F6F7`)
- No static/mock portal data in `src/` — APIs only; show loading/error/empty
- Do not reintroduce Skill Courses, Email Management CRUD, AI Usage ₹ dashboard, or student billing UI
- **No plan / licence / subscription product** in Phase 1 B2B — see `.cursor/rules/quirri-no-plans.mdc`
- Follow Quirri tokens in `src/styles/quirri-design.css`
